    "audio_frames": 85,
    "transcript": "What does return to home do if I lose the radio link?",
    "turn_id": "23bcfb14bedf-001",
    "response": "If the radio link is lost, the drone will automatically activate its Return\u2011to\u2011Home (RTH) mode. It uses its GPS and onboard sensors to fly back to the launch point or a pre\u2011set waypoint, then lands once it reaches that location. If GPS is unavailable, it will hover and attempt to return using inertial navigation until it can re\u2011establish a signal.",
