    "audio_frames": 75,
    "transcript": "Explain the difference between GPS mode and attitude mode.",
    "turn_id": "227d41ff86db-001",
    "response": "GPS mode uses satellite positioning to hold a set location and altitude, letting the drone automatically maintain position. Attitude mode relies only on the onboard IMU, keeping a set pitch, roll, yaw and altitude but not referencing GPS, so it can drift if GPS is lost.",
